From 5242b3e00a935b09e70aec2a4de68fcbba3095b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
Date: Mon, 20 May 2024 16:00:08 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 03/45] drivers: gpio: mec5: Microchip MEC5 HAL based GPIO
 driver

Add a GPIO driver for the Microchip MEC5 HAL based chips.
Current devices are: MEC174x, MEC175x, and HAL version of
MEC172x named MECH172x.

Signed-off-by: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
---
