From 5bfc373b3878707f31205d550d085a236cf4efd5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
Date: Mon, 20 May 2024 16:43:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 06/45] drivers: serial: mec5: Add Microchip MEC5 HAL based
 UART driver

Serial UART driver for Microchip MEC5 HAL based chips. This UART
is a 16550 compatible design. These UARTs can be made accessible
to the Host over the eSPI bus. Power management uses suspend to ram
as the deep sleep state. Suspend to RAM is blocked by the driver
when data is in the TX or RX FIFOs.

Signed-off-by: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
