From c030dfe03165cf164c6ddeaf00bcf8edcae31e5e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
Date: Mon, 20 May 2024 16:53:57 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 07/45] drivers: spi: microchip: Add SPI driver for MEC5 HAL
 quad SPI

SPI driver for Microchip MEC5 HAL based QSPI controller. QSPI is
capable of single, dual, and quad opertion. It includes three
local DMA channels for each direction to off load firmware.

Signed-off-by: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
