From a425288ce9d3be2968bec3d6f84e247a48fe7122 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
Date: Mon, 20 May 2024 17:02:51 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 08/45] drivers: i2c: microchip: Add I2C driver for MEC5 HAL
 byte mode I2C

Add a byte mode I2C driver for Microchip MEC5 HAL based chips.
Initial version of this driver supports controller mode only.

Signed-off-by: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
---
 drivers/i2c/CMakeLists.txt               |    1 +
 drivers/i2c/Kconfig                      |    1 +
 drivers/i2c/Kconfig.mec5                 |   11 +
 drivers/i2c/i2c_mchp_mec5.c              | 1035 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 dts/arm/microchip/mec5.dtsi              |    1 +
 dts/bindings/i2c/microchip,mec5-i2c.yaml |   37 +
 6 files changed, 1086 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/i2c/Kconfig.mec5
