From 5b8dc3cbff8f29f8cf1cc02fb6781dcbd345f524 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
Date: Mon, 20 May 2024 17:12:42 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 10/45] drivers: counter: microchip: Add MEC5 counter driver
 using RTOS timer

Add a counter driver for the Microchip 32 KHz RTOS timer using
the MEC5 HAL. Note there are two drivers using the RTOS timer.
This one and the kernel timer driver. Only one should be loaded.
If application uses ARM SysTick for the kernel timer then this
driver can be enabled and used by the SysTick kernel timer as
the timer for low power mode.

Signed-off-by: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
