From 0decea308731b6c3739a43844fd6df604dbe92ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
Date: Tue, 21 May 2024 09:13:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 11/45] drivers: dma: microchip: Add centralized DMA driver
 MEC5 HAL chips

Microchip MEC5 HAL based SoC's MEC174x, MEC175x, and MECH172x
centralized DMA peripheral implements multiple channels for use
as memory to memory, memory to peripheral, and peripheral to memory
transfers. DMA hardware does not implement scatter-gather or channel
linking. Memory and device address may be constant or increment, no
address decrement. The peripherals are fixed: I2C, QSPI, GP-SPI, and
I3C.

Signed-off-by: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
---
