From 908765380f6338f5070e90edc9df6bf49fa10ce7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
Date: Tue, 21 May 2024 11:28:02 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 15/45] drivers: i3c: microchip: Add MEC175x MEC5 HAL based I3C
 driver

Microchip MEC175x include I3C host and secondary controllers
with multiple ports. MEC175x is based on the new MEC5 HAL and
this I3C driver makes use of MEC5 HAL version 0.2

Signed-off-by: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
