From c7bbcf02407b5d3ffa93eb676e1d40263ae403b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Jun 2024 18:44:08 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 18/45] drivers: espi: microchip: MEC5 eSPI host sub-device
 interrupt API change

Many Microchip eSPI host sub-devices have multiple interrupts to
the EC and Host(Serial IRQ over Vwire channel). Extend the host
device interrupt enable API with a third parameter to indicate
which interrupt enables to change.

Signed-off-by: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
---
 drivers/espi/mchp/mec5/hd_acpi_ec_hcmd.c     |  30 ++++-
 drivers/espi/mchp/mec5/hd_acpi_ec_os.c       |  31 ++++-
 drivers/espi/mchp/mec5/hd_bdp.c              |   2 +-
