From cc8ee47acb8aadb3519ecdd0322e4df6faecb34e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
Date: Tue, 21 May 2024 17:20:11 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 27/45] samples: boards: mchp_mec5: eSPI target sample for
 Microchip MEC5 HAL

Add an eSPI target sample appliction using Microchip MEC5 HAL based
MEC1743, MEC1753, or MECH1723. Note: MEC1743 and MEC1753 use the
assembly 6941 EVB and MECH1723 uses the assembly 6906 EVB. The EVB
can be fly wired to a reference board containing the eSPI host
controller.

Signed-off-by: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
