Subject: [PATCH 28/45] samples: boards: mchp_mec5: Sample eSPI host controller
 emulation

Sample application implementing a primite emulation of an eSPI host
controller using the MEC QSPI controller. The purpose is to test
the eSPI driver by wiring this EVB to another running the eSPI
target sample application. We emulate an eSPI host controller
providing flow of enabling the eSPI interface and some virtual
wire and simple I/O transactions.

