Subject: [PATCH 29/45] samples: boards: mchp_mec5: I2C sample using Microchip
 EVB I2C devices

A sample I2C application communicating with I2C devices on the
Microchip EVB board. All devices are on I2C port 0. One device,
the MB85RC256V a 32KB I2C FRAM is external and must be wired
to the board. The FRAM allows long read/write sequences to be
exercised.

Signed-off-by: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
