From df811ac8ae485ee9cacd259041be0ba44c1169bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Jun 2024 22:08:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 31/45] samples: boards: mchp_mec5: Add I2C network layer
 driver example

Add an example of using the in progress I2C network layer driver.
The target device is a 32 KB I2C FRAM wired to I2C port 4.
We use I2C controller 1 for I2C network layer driver.

Signed-off-by: Scott Worley <scott.worley@microchip.com>
---
 samples/boards/mchp_mec5/i2c/CMakeLists.txt |   3 +-
 samples/boards/mchp_mec5/i2c/app.overlay    |  56 ++++-
 samples/boards/mchp_mec5/i2c/prj.conf       |   2 +
 samples/boards/mchp_mec5/i2c/src/main.c     | 246 ++++++++++++++++++--
 4 files changed, 283 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)

